{\fSwis721 Cn BT|b1|i0|c0|p34;\LGENERAL NOTES}\P\A1;1. THESE DRAWINGS SHALL BE READ WITH THE ARCHITECTURAL AND MEP DRAWINGS. ANY DISCREPANCY SHALL BE REFERRED TO THE ENGINEER BEFORE WORK PROCEEDS.\P2. DESIGN CODE: BNBC 2020, ACI 318-19 WHERE THE CODE
  3
 IS SILENT.\P3. IMPOSED LOAD 2.0 kN/m%%2 (RESIDENTIAL), PARTITION 1.5 kN/m%%2, FINISH 1.2 kN/m%%2. BASIC WIND SPEED 65.7 m/s, SEISMIC ZONE 2 (Z=0.20).\P4. ALL DIMENSIONS ARE IN MILLIMETRES UNLESS FIGURED IN FEET AND INCHES. LEVELS ARE IN METRES ABOVE
  1
 P.L.\P5. {\LDO NOT SCALE THIS DRAWING} - FIGURED DIMENSIONS GOVERN.\P
  7
